   "stem_html": "<ol start=\"6\">\n<li>Identify which step the mistake is made in finding an equivalent equation to <span data-math=\"2x +3x -4 = 20\">2x +3x -4 = 20</span>.</li>\n</ol>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type:none;\">\n<li><strong>Step 1:</strong> <span data-math=\"5x - 4 =20\">5x - 4 =20</span></li>\n<li><strong>Step 2:</strong> <span data-math=\"5x = 16\">5x = 16</span></li>\n<li><strong>Step 3:</strong> <span data-math=\"x =16/5\">x =16/5</span></li>\n</ul>",
